# No binary feature flags

Do not add an env variable or a host check that turns product behaviour on
or off, or picks A or B. Dev and production run the same product. A flag
needed to land a change is removed within one week; removing it keeps dev's
behaviour and adds no env variable. SoT: `~/.cstack/src/docs/FEATURE-FLAGS.md`
and sume-com `docs/operations/feature-flags.md`.
